[{"t":"Winding Machines","m":"","f":"Family","u":"/products/winding-machines/","k":"Air-coil, armature and stator winding across brushed, brushless and universal motors. Servo-driven wire placement, programmable tension, and multi-station configurations for higher throughput."},{"t":"Rotor \u0026 Armature Equipment","m":"","f":"Family","u":"/products/motor-rotor-equipment/","k":"The complete armature route: slot insulation and wedge insertion, hook-type winding, commutator slot cutting and assembly, shaft embossing, welding and fusing, turning, balancing, varnish bake and final test."},{"t":"Brushless Motor Equipment","m":"","f":"Family","u":"/products/brushless-motor-equipment/","k":"Dedicated BLDC stator preparation — horizontal and vertical slot insulation paper insertion, wedge insertion, and stator fusing. The equipment behind e-mobility, drone and cooling-fan motor programmes."},{"t":"Modular Production Lines","m":"","f":"Family","u":"/products/modular-production-lines/","k":"Standard machine modules linked into a running line — bobbin production, cooling-fan motor assembly, and configurable winding cells. Capacity is added by adding modules, not by replacing the line."},{"t":"Custom Production Equipment","m":"","f":"Family","u":"/products/custom-production-equipment/","k":"Purpose-built automation where a catalogue machine does not fit: automatic feeding systems, turntable assembly cells and vibration-feed assembly equipment, designed around the part."},{"t":"Robotic Production Lines","m":"","f":"Family","u":"/products/robotic-production-lines/","k":"SCARA and six-axis integration for handling, loading and inter-station transfer — used where cycle time or part geometry rules out fixed automation."},{"t":"Stator Equipment","m":"","f":"Family","u":"/products/motor-stator-equipment/","k":"Stator slot insulation paper insertion and varnish bake, for brushed and universal motor stators."},{"t":"Semiconductor Process Equipment","m":"","f":"Family","u":"/products/se